WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.120
Social value can carry real marks in a tender.

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:10.090
It is the wider good your work brings, such as good jobs, fair pay and skills.

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:18.380
Velstrian Bid is built around PPN zero two six, the government's social value guidance for central government work from January twenty twenty seven.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:25.230
Choose your measures and describe how you will deliver them. For private work, you answer the buyer's own questions the same way.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.640
Velstrian Bid.
